--- a date32 branch is excluded by design, so this stays rejected ---
Cannot convert type Variant(Date32, String) to Variant(Int32, String).
--- two branches may never end up on one alternative ---
Cannot convert type Variant(Bool, UInt8) to Variant(String, UInt8).
--- an ambiguous branch gets no alternative, so this stays rejected ---
Cannot convert type Variant(FixedString(16), String) to Variant(IPv6, Int128).
--- and where every branch is assigned, a value that cannot convert is reported as itself ---
(CANNOT_PARSE_IPV6)
